WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:13.000
This dashboard tracks one hundred and fifty-one bills, ninety-four recorded votes, and three hundred and forty Members of Parliament in the forty-fifth Canadian Parliament — every data point sourced from the official Hansard record and LEGISinfo.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.840
Bills are filterable by category, status, and party breakdown; every vote is mapped to the MP who cast it.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:24.977
When parliamentarians claim they didn't know what they were voting for, this dashboard is the receipts.
